{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":50,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我休你们的母亲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"休书在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我将你们卖给我哪一个债主呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们被卖，是因你们的罪孽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的母亲被休，是因你们的过犯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我来的时候，为何无人等候呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我呼唤的时候，为何无人答应呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的膀臂岂是缩短、不能救赎吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂无拯救之力吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我一斥责，海就干了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使江河变为旷野；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的鱼因无水腥臭，干渴而死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使诸天以黑暗为衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以麻布为遮盖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华仆人的顺服"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"主耶和华赐我受教者的舌头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我知道怎样用言语扶助疲乏的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主每早晨提醒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提醒我的耳朵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我能听，像受教者一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华开通我的耳朵；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我并没有违背，也没有退后。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人打我的背，我任他打；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人拔我腮颊的胡须，我由他拔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人辱我，吐我，我并不掩面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"主耶和华必帮助我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我不抱愧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我硬着脸面好像坚石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也知道我必不致蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"称我为义的与我相近；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁与我争论，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以与我一同站立；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁与我作对，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以就近我来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华要帮助我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能定我有罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都像衣服渐渐旧了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为蛀虫所咬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们中间谁是敬畏耶和华、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听从他仆人之话的？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这人行在暗中，没有亮光。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当倚靠耶和华的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仗赖自己的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡你们点火，用火把围绕自己的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以行在你们的火焰里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并你们所点的火把中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是我手所定的：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必躺在悲惨之中。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/50.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/51.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/49.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}